                <div class="postingContent">
		
                    <p class="MsoNormal">Canyon Springs is located in Cathedral City, Riverside County, 110 miles southeast of Los Angeles in the Coachella Valley.
Recreation/cultural attractions include golf, tennis, desert preserves, parks,
rock climbing, hiking, biking, museums, art galleries, and theater. Next door
is well-known city of Palm Springs. Although known as a winter resort area,
increasing numbers are making the Coachella Valley their year-round home. There are&nbsp;schools&nbsp;and shopping nearby.</p>

